.DS_Store

# A sample of real records, fetched by generate/sample.py to measure things
# about the data rather than about the shape. Not checked in: it is whatever
# stage happened to hold on the day, it goes stale the moment the catalogue
# moves, and conformance/ is the part that belongs in the repository -- cases
# written by hand, one per rule, that say what the shape requires.
corpus/

# LC's description of how they serialize CBD documents. Reference material,
# not ours to redistribute; conformance/cbd/ is where its rules are written
# down in a form this repository owns.
cbd-01.md

# The documentation site, assembled by generate/site.py and deployed from CI.
# It is a copy of artifacts that are already in the repository, so checking it
# in would mean two copies of every schema and a way for them to disagree.
site/

# The Starlight docs site: dependencies, build output and Astro cache.
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
# Artifacts copied in by src/integrations/artifacts.mjs from where they
# already live in the repository. Generated, so not checked in.
public/
